Currently, for you to win the President seat in Kenya you need to have the following; 

1. A solid tribal voting block from a primary tribe .In Kenya we have 5 primary political tribes; Kikuyu block, Kalenjin block, Luhya block ,Luo block and Kamba block.

2.Resources; A political party, advisors, e

@MutahiNgunyi Mutahi, Kenya is not your tribal calculator anymore.
Kenyans are not asking “which tribe should Ruto court?” They are asking about taxes, abductions, police brutality, media intimidation, corruption and jobs.
Ol Kalou was not a rejection of Kikuyus or an invitation to Luos.

The biggest security threat Kenya is currently facing ahead of 2027 is;

1. Unofficial plain clothes police units  that take orders from politicians and civil servants.

2. Goons on the payroll of politicians working with both uniformed and plain clothes police.
